cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Ulap Digital Twin: a 6G propagation study pipeline"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Zoe Aiyanna M."
    family-names: Cayetano
    affiliation: "Amini Labs"
  - given-names: "George M."
    family-names: Gichuru
    affiliation: "Amini Labs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aminitech/amini-ulap-digital-twin"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end pipeline for building geospatially accurate digital twins and
  running 6G radio propagation studies over them. Clips authoritative
  geospatial layers to a study area, builds a textured 3D scene in Blender,
  exports it to Mitsuba, and runs ray-traced coverage, path gain, and SINR
  analyses in NVIDIA Sionna. Includes an interactive study wizard that lets a
  user define a new study area anywhere in the world from open data sources.
keywords:
  - digital twin
  - 6G
  - ISAC
  - radio propagation
  - ray tracing
  - Sionna
  - Mitsuba
  - geospatial
  - small island developing states
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0

